        {
          "id": 3002800192,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "While this is a valid fix renaming the lib itself may be better. There are slighly more libs with `-` in their name, than ones containing `_`:\n\n```\nrbalint@nano:~$ apt-file search /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu | sed 's|.*/||' | grep '.-' | wc -l\n75068\nrbalint@nano:~$ apt-file search /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu | sed 's|.*/||' | grep '._' | wc -l\n62412\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 7384671,
            "username": "rbalint",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Balint Reczey",
            "state": "active",
