      "title": "debian: libuiqt-plugin: fix override_dh_makeshlibs",
      "message": "debian: libuiqt-plugin: fix override_dh_makeshlibs\n\nAdjust override_dh_makeshlibs, so it writes libuiqt_plugin0 to the\nshlibs file instead of libuiqt-plugin0 to fix:\n\ndpkg-shlibdeps: error: no dependency information found for debian/libuiqt-plugin0/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libuiqt_plugin.so.0 (used by debian/wireshark/usr/bin/wireshark)\n\nFixes: fe085dcc4086c21b985424f43ee595a01a0a4512\n",
      "author_name": "Oliver Smith",
      "author_email": "osmith@sysmocom.de",
