      "title": "debian: libuiqt-plugin0.install: fix filename",
      "message": "debian: libuiqt-plugin0.install: fix filename\n\nRename libuiqt_plugin0.install to libuiqt-plugin0.install to fix the\nfollowing error while attempting to build the debian package:\n\ndpkg-shlibdeps: error: cannot find library libuiqt_plugin.so.0 needed by debian/wireshark/usr/bin/wireshark (ELF format: 'elf64-x86-64' abi: '0201003e00000000'; RPATH: '')\n\nThis was missing from an earlier patch that renamed the subpackage.\n\nFixes: fe085dcc4086c21b985424f43ee595a01a0a4512\n",
      "author_name": "Oliver Smith",
